WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
(gentle music)

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.640
Competitive pricing is critical for success

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.800
when selling in the Amazon store,

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.080
but manual price monitoring and adjustments

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.960
can be time consuming.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:15.200
The automate pricing tool provides a fast, convenient way

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.080
to keep your prices competitive

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.560
within the guidelines you set.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.520
This tool is available to sellers

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.760
with the professional or Amazon business selling plans

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.600
and can apply rules to standard retail prices

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.480
or business prices.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.560
You can choose from a variety of different pricing rules

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.160
in each category.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.600
Some rules can run parallel to each other.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.760
For example, business price rules and consumer price rules.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.560
One example is competitive featured offer,

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:46.080
which allows you to set your price to be below,

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.000
match or above the featured offer.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.440
Repricing stops when you are the featured offer.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.520
This rule type is useful when there are multiple sellers

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.560
offering the same product.

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.240
If you are also a business seller,

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.800
you can set your business prices

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.360
to adjust alongside this rule,

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.880
automatically keeping your business prices lower

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:09.200
than your competitive featured offer price.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.280
After creating a pricing rule,

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.080
you can apply it to as many SKUs as you want.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.960
If you manually update your price

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:18.160
or stop using automate pricing,

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:21.560
the system will maintain the price you last set.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:24.120
Ready to start using automate pricing?

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:26.440
Search create custom pricing rules

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:29.440
in seller university to learn how.
